oint. Framed as deliberate choice, not a gap."}, {"id": "prompt_taobat_valley_fares", "label": "Taobat Valley fares (Kel 14-16k, Sharda 20-22k PKR per jeep)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "section 5c", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompt_per_jeep_pricing", "label": "Price per jeep, range with reason, ratesUpdated line", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "section 5c", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jeep hire quoted per vehicle; a range without a reason reads as arbitrary; ratesUpdated protects owner from stale fuel-price numbers."}, {"id": "prompt_how_it_works_strip", "label": "Tours 'How it works' three-step strip", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "section 5c", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guests who assume every tour starts at the resort never message."}, {"id": "prompt_pickup_selector", "label": "PickupSelect pick-up selector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "section 5c", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only composes the WhatsApp message; no price updates or fetching."}, {"id": "prompt_fare_list", "label": "FareList component", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "Phase 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompt_price_tag", "label": "PriceTag component (rooms only)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "Phase 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompt_whatsapp_flow", "label": "WhatsApp flow (wa.me entry points)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PROMPT.md", "source_location": "section 6